## CRITICAL: How to Invoke External Agents

**External agents (Validator, Critic, Worker-Lite) are invoked via PowerShell scripts using the Bash tool.**

This is NOT optional. Do NOT look for:
- ❌ Task tool subagent types named "validator" or "critic"
- ❌ MCP tools for validation
- ❌ Other native Claude Code mechanisms

**The ONLY way to invoke external agents is:**
```
Bash tool → powershell -File ".ai/scripts/[script-name].ps1" [parameters]
```

**Example - Validate a decision:**
```bash
powershell -File ".ai/scripts/validate-autonomy.ps1" -Decision "Is my plan correct?" -Context "Planning to add auth middleware"
```

**Example - Run Critic quality gate:**
```bash
powershell -File ".ai/scripts/bias-control.ps1" -Phase "questions" -Context "Added login feature with tests"
```

