## Quality Gates

Every deliverable must pass:

1. **Build** - `{{BUILD_COMMAND}}` completes without errors
2. **Tests** - ALL tests pass (no exceptions)
3. **Coverage** - Must not decrease
4. **Validator** - Approval at checkpoints (confidence >= 0.7)
5. **Critic** - Quality gate passed (viability >= 0.80)
6. **Security** - No exposed secrets
7. **Git** - Proper branch, proper commit format

---

## Error Recovery

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Build fails | Fix errors, don't proceed until green |
| Tests fail | Investigate, fix, re-run - no commit without passing tests |
| Validator rejects | Revise approach, re-submit (max 2 attempts, then escalate) |
| Critic fails | Implement remediation tasks, re-run quality gate |
| Security issue | Block commit, report to user immediately |
| Unclear requirement | Ask user, don't assume |
| 3+ consecutive rejections | **CIRCUIT BREAKER** - Stop and escalate to user |

